{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"旺角兩的士相撞釀六傷\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-15-07-21-25YXsAWsFF.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】旺角凌晨有兩輛的士相撞，六人受傷。</p><p>兩輛的士車頭毀爛、零件散落一地，交通燈及鐵欄被撞毀。凌晨一時許，兩輛的士於洗衣街與弼街交界相撞，兩名司機及四名乘客受傷，在現場初步治理後，由救護車送往廣華醫院。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T00:06:06.768477+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T23:05:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T18:39:15.864628+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:24.696286+00:00","content_hash":"2e99d35f77ef54383b83cd49feefa390db2148e6f5cca1186027e68be07c062c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T00:06:06.768477+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}